# Brain Changelog

## 2026-06-04 - Alpha-3 FES Runtime Chain

### Added
- brain/cli/ - Brain CLI canonical structure ✅
  - command.rs, router.rs, executor.rs
  - model.rs, lora.rs, replay.rs, inspect.rs, profile.rs, benchmark.rs
- brain/io/ - Brain I/O bridge layer ✅
  - rac.rs, raci.rs, racin.rs, racex.rs
  - route.rs, sio.rs
- brain/coge/ - Coge (Edge Execution) module ✅
  - run.rs, infer.rs, lora.rs
- brain/master/src/
  - kernel/ (BrainKernel trait) ✅
  - inference/ (InferenceEngine trait) ✅
  - provider/mock.rs (MockProvider for testing) ✅
- brain/canon/ - FES architecture spec ✅
  - brain.ail, providers.ail, routing.ail
- brain/milestones/ - CRD directives ✅
  - alpha-3-real-inference-roadmap.ail

### Changed
- cli/src/bin/hace.rs - Added brain subcommand
- master/src/lib.rs - Added kernel + inference modules
- master/src/dispatcher.rs - Dynamic dispatch (Box<dyn BrainProvider>)
- master/src/provider/mod.rs - Added ProviderCapability + MockProvider

### Structure
```text
brain/
├── cli/        (AS - 80%)
├── io/         (IO - 100%)
├── coge/       (Coge - 100%)
├── master/
│   ├── kernel/ (TI - 50%)
│   ├── provider/ (PI - 60%)
│   └── inference/ (Engine - 50%)
├── canon/      (Spec - 100%)
└── milestones/ (CRD - 100%)
```

### Status
- Architecture: 95% ✅
- Runtime Chain: 70% ⏳
- Mock Provider: Ready for E2E test
- Next: Wire MockProvider to validate full chain